# Edit home (Pavilion-first)

**Shared product** (visitor, member portal, staff) is authored in **`~/pavilion`**.  
www.shmspto.org is **customer #1** — dedicated deploy from **`~/shmspto`**, updated by promote.

## Where to edit

| Surface | Edit in |
|---------|---------|
| Shared product (site / portal / staff) | **`~/pavilion`** (this repo) |
| Demo / brand packs / trial CRM / marketing | **`~/pavilion`** |
| SHMS-only ops (Wix CMS wiring, school env, production hotfix) | **`~/shmspto`** |

### Product vs CMS backend (critical)

| Layer | Home |
|-------|------|
| **Product code** (Staff UIs, APIs, form queues, checkout) | Always author in **`~/pavilion`** |
| **Pavilion CMS** (Postgres `cms_*`, org-scoped) | **Authoritative** content store for demo, trials, and all Pavilion customers. Built on pavilion. |
| **Platform owners** (`@onpavilion.com`) | Overarching Staff admins. Can switch customer org and edit that CMS. See `docs/PAVILION-CMS.md`. |
| **Wix CMS** | **SHMS publish target only.** After content is right in Pavilion CMS, sync/commit those rows into Wix and promote staff code to `~/shmspto`. |

Build Staff queues and page/settings editors **on pavilion** against Pavilion CMS. For SHMS www: sync CMS → Wix, then ship shmspto.

See `docs/PAVILION-CMS.md`.

Do **not** treat “uses Wix on SHMS” as “commit only on shmspto.” Shared product stays pavilion-first.

Pushing `pavilion` `main` does **not** update www. Promoting + shipping SHMS does — **avoid casual promotes during school hours.**

### Fall EP registration season (soft)

During Fall enrichment registration, prefer **pavilion-only** for proactive / non-critical work (Pavilion CMS, demo, product). Do **not** promote, ship www, or poke live Wix “just because.”

**Still do SHMS work when Rob asks** for a fix or update that must hit www. Hotfixes and requested ships are fine; unsolicited production changes are not.

## Promote to Stone Hill (intentional)

```bash
node scripts/promote-to-shms.mjs
# then ~/shmspto → node scripts/ship-stone-hill.mjs
```

## Hotfix discipline

If you must fix www first: edit `~/shmspto` → `ship-stone-hill.mjs` → **same day** port into pavilion with `--from-shms` (emergency only).

## Anti-patterns (forbidden)

- Treating `~/shmspto` as the place to build new shared product
- Skipping pavilion product work because “SHMS uses Wix”
- Wiring Pavilion demo/product to live Stone Hill Wix
- Auto-promoting to SHMS after every demo ship
- `vercel link` / deploy Stone Hill from this monorepo
- Calling Stone Hill “shipped” after only pushing pavilion
